INSERT INTO `quotes` VALUES (2,NULL,NULL,320,'2019-08-02 13:26:47','2019-08-02 13:26:47'),(20004,'Looking for these jerseys for next years team. Would like to have our logo included. I\'ll have to find a pic.\r\n\r\nPlease contact by EMAIL ONLY.',NULL,344,'2019-08-06 15:04:21','2019-08-06 15:04:21'),(20005,'Our team loves the this orange mock jersey you have made with the Knigts logo, what would the cost be for 20 sets including socks?',NULL,348,'2019-08-06 18:05:14','2019-08-06 18:05:14'),(20006,'We would like the the front to say \"Marauders\" with the bird and crest from our logo on the left (under the wording. \n\nWe would like the back to have a number and name.\n\nThank you! I look forward to hearing from you.','August 21st, 2019',351,'2019-08-07 14:48:09','2019-08-07 14:48:09'),(20007,'We would like the Logo to be on the front and center \nthe name to be on the top above number and the number ont he back center \n\nI have attached 2 attachments of my logo one of the picture one of the logo being made from last years vendor. \n\nI would like it to say BOMB MOMS not Bomb mom The S needs to be there. \n\nALL JERSEYS ARE WOMEN\'S ADULT','SEPT 10, 2019',354,'2019-08-13 17:03:18','2019-08-13 17:03:18'),(20008,'I would like a visual of the logo on the crest of the jersey and also a visual of the logo with the matching socks(on the socks). I need these visuals ASAP as hockey season start soon and we need to make a decision with what we are going with.\n\nThank you','2019-08-15',355,'2019-08-14 00:06:21','2019-08-14 00:06:21'),(20009,'Would like to have a tiger/lion claw logo on the sleeve.','August 14',356,'2019-08-14 05:14:29','2019-08-14 05:14:29'),(20010,'strangerswingslogo (attached) placed on front center of jersey, player name and number on the back for 11 males and 4 females for a softball team. Font used for logo also attached (Benguiat Bold). Looking for jerseys as fast as possible, will be used for company event.','As soon as possible',359,'2019-08-15 04:43:53','2019-08-15 04:43:53'),(20011,'Artwork: front-center; logo color switching between color 1 and 2 depending on the background. E.g. Cardianal logo when base is Powder, vice versa. \n\nNumbers and name on the back: same as above, flip flop of colors.\n\nThank you!','ASAP, preferably by August 16th!',360,'2019-08-15 19:14:11','2019-08-15 19:14:11'),(20012,'We would only like the number and names on the back NO NUMBER ON FRONT please \n\nThe logo only on the front \nNumber and Last names on the back \n\nCan the logo be all in the colors of black and white letters back bomb into a pink black and white tnt exploding volleyball on the top \n\nIf not i would prefer black and white logo but if you can interpret pink in the logo somewhere that would be awesome.','September 10,2019',361,'2019-08-16 16:24:00','2019-08-16 16:24:00'),(20013,'Centered logo and on the left shoulder if possible. \n\n5 small\n6 medium\n8 large\n2 xl\n\nI have logos in eps/.ai.pdf if needed.',NULL,362,'2019-08-16 18:05:04','2019-08-16 18:05:04'),(20014,'Centered logo attached and one on the right arm.\n\nwe need 5 small 6 medium 8 large and 2 xl.','next summer',363,'2019-08-16 18:07:58','2019-08-16 18:07:58'),(20015,'Our team name is Balls Deep and we would just like the writing on the front like most other teams . We do have a sponsor and we would like names on the back. Looking for pricing .','Aug 16 2019',364,'2019-08-16 18:42:00','2019-08-16 18:42:00'),(20016,'Hi. I’m looking for the 90s style Blues jersey. Custom logo and shoulder patch. Not sure if I want names or not. But numbers for sure. What would be an estimated cost?\r\n\r\nThanks.',NULL,365,'2019-08-17 16:21:35','2019-08-17 16:21:35'),(20017,'Hello,\r\n\r\nI saw this concept Raptors uniform and was wondering if you can replicate it?\r\n\r\nWe would need at least 7 uniforms.\r\nHow much would it be for just the jerseys?\r\n\r\nWe would also need a number on the front and back and a name just on the back.\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nWarren',NULL,367,'2019-08-19 14:04:48','2019-08-19 14:04:48'),(20018,'We would like to purchase 35 track jerseys to use for our cross country, badminton and track and field teams.  As for numbers we aren\'t too concerned what they are, the numbers would be more for tracking purposes.   As for sizes I can get that to you once the mock up comes back.  The biggest issue right now is that we have money in our school budget that needs to be spent before August 31st but this also means having the order in our hands (for auditing purposes) by August 31st or we won\'t be able to use our current budget for this.  So if it is doable and can be guaranteed that we can have this by august 31st then we would like to go with your company. If you don\'t think it will work then I totally understand.','August 31st',368,'2019-08-19 16:06:34','2019-08-19 16:06:34'),(20019,'We would supply a logo and would like numbers on the back.','Aug 28/19',369,'2019-08-19 17:37:45','2019-08-19 17:37:45'),(20020,'We are looking for some decent quality Jersey/shorts. We have been the \"mustangs\" for the last couple years but might be changing our name. I was thinking a purple and black colour scheme similar to the retro Raptors jerseys.','8/19/2019',378,'2019-08-19 21:27:15','2019-08-19 21:27:15'),(20021,'Looking for a mockup to see the jerseys. The logo attached should be on the left chest and only a few inches large, and on each sleeve, if possible. Across the back over the shoulders, I\'d like to have the player\'s name \"Acarcion\" in white.',NULL,379,'2019-08-20 00:23:31','2019-08-20 00:23:31'),(20022,NULL,NULL,388,'2019-08-20 13:03:48','2019-08-20 13:03:48'),(20023,'looking to get this printed on a black & white reversible basketball jersey.',NULL,395,'2019-08-20 23:41:13','2019-08-20 23:41:13'),(20024,NULL,NULL,397,'2019-08-21 10:24:53','2019-08-21 10:24:53'),(20025,NULL,NULL,398,'2019-08-21 10:25:39','2019-08-21 10:25:39'),(20026,NULL,NULL,399,'2019-08-21 10:29:43','2019-08-21 10:29:43'),(20027,NULL,NULL,400,'2019-08-21 10:32:41','2019-08-21 10:32:41'),(20028,'I would like to have the logo attacthed added on to the jerseys its from another one of our jerseys but i cant find the original ! have everyone names n number on the back with 2 libero jerseys !','September 25th',414,'2019-08-21 13:03:28','2019-08-21 13:03:28'),(20029,'Mossy on the back wearing the number 77, and could you model after the Tampa bay lightning jerseys. Not sure if I picked the oprpreate blue jersey for them .',NULL,428,'2019-08-21 17:56:10','2019-08-21 17:56:10'),(20030,'Colour scheme as per saved stock jersey design. White, Red, Black\r\n\r\nCDQ Maple leaf logo to shoulders in red and black on white background. No tag line or Puerto Rico text.\r\n\r\nPull the CDQ circle from centre of leaf logo - place 1.25\" diameter on Front chest centred just below point of V-neck \r\n\r\nNumber 17 to front chest and back in BLACK\r\n\r\nPEPSI on back above name in BLACK','Nov 15, 2019',429,'2019-08-21 18:47:43','2019-08-21 18:47:43'),(20031,'NO MERCY\n              00\n\n Lettering in silver with a black outline\ncan you show me one with the number on top and on with it below the name \n\n and on the back just say \"friends till the end\" in nice lettering','september 16 2019',434,'2019-08-22 15:13:21','2019-08-22 15:13:21'),(20032,'Team name is the \"GOATS\" \nthen with the tiny picture of a GOAT face.\nAlso wondering if the numbers could be a white or gray, not red',NULL,436,'2019-08-23 00:12:04','2019-08-23 00:12:04'),(20033,'Team name  is àces, I\'d like the  name  aces with the  4 aces cards behind the  name.','Aug 30th',437,'2019-08-23 09:58:18','2019-08-23 09:58:18'),(20034,'Trojan Logo on Front Right Chest in Black.  Number on Front Left Chest in Black.  Number on Back Center in Black.  TROJANS on Name Position on back in Black.',NULL,438,'2019-08-23 18:53:49','2019-08-23 18:53:49'),(20035,'We are not entirely sure of the other logo just yet, but thinking to have numbers on the back with \"The Ultras\" above the number, with the Good Ninas logo small on the left hand side of the upper front.','unknown',439,'2019-08-23 21:17:13','2019-08-23 21:17:13'),(20036,'Can I have Navy #s outlined with Forest in both front and back? \n\nAs for logo, is .svg the correct format? If so, could you make the logo navy?\n\nThe team name is Alpha Bravo, can the mock show the words circling the logo? Alpha on top, Bravo below. Navy letters with Forest outline, please.','August 27th, 28th?',440,'2019-08-24 18:54:26','2019-08-24 18:54:26'),(20037,'Vixens Logo to be situated on RIGHT CHEST.\nPlease note the circle* around the logo should be closed/ complete (I was limited by the design program), and the fox can be the deepest yellow-gold that looks best in contrast with the red/black/white jersey. \n*The circle around the logo could also be the same selected colour of the fox IF it suits the design. \nThe background of the logo (the inner circle) stays white.\nFor the rear mock-up please include my last name HAWRYSH and the number 14 below it.\nPlease let me know if I can answer any more questions.\nThank you so much.\n-Cassie','BEFORE our first game (scheduled for Sept 23, 2019)',441,'2019-08-25 19:22:29','2019-08-25 19:22:29'),(20038,'Has to say EMCO OAKVILLE as well as KOHLER somewhere on the jersey.','asap',442,'2019-08-26 17:47:18','2019-08-26 17:47:18'),(20039,'I would like the team name and logo on the front and the player number on the back.','september 23rd',445,'2019-08-27 14:58:27','2019-08-27 14:58:27'),(20040,'I would like to use the Hawk that is pictured and instead of a name bar I\'d like to have the sponser Mark\'s across the shoulder everything else can stay the same.','Oct 1st 2019',447,'2019-08-28 14:50:57','2019-08-28 14:50:57'),(20041,'I’m looking for the jersey and shorts together. Even plain shorts might be ok. \r\nI’ll have to get you the artwork',NULL,449,'2019-08-28 16:53:52','2019-08-28 16:53:52'),(20042,NULL,NULL,451,'2019-08-28 20:56:16','2019-08-28 20:56:16'),(20043,'Hey, Im not sure if this is how you want it done, but Ill start with this and you can let me know if you need something else.\n\nKnights Logo is the main logo\nThe Shoulder M goes on both left and right shoulders\nDale Air and Remples files are sponsorship that we want across the Lower Back\nCanadian Flag on the Left Chest\nThe Word: Knights below the Collar (in a style that looks like it suits) \n\nWe are just waiting on the final sponsorship requests and then we can order them up. but we would like something to show the businesses. Thank you, Kevin','Oct 15/19',452,'2019-08-28 21:32:12','2019-08-28 21:32:12'),(20044,'Team name: BOOM \r\nInstead of the black inside boom I want it white in the middle and orange/tangerine outlined around the BOOM and also the numbers in the front and back. And want it too say RAIN in the last name and 22 as the number. And what’s the biggest jersey you go up too? And can these come with white pants and the number on the pants also?','April 2020',453,'2019-08-28 21:52:25','2019-08-28 21:52:25'),(20045,'The blue logo is it possible. Numbers 1-13','Sept 9-10',454,'2019-08-29 01:05:47','2019-08-29 01:05:47'),(20046,'I would like the blue jerseys. Team name the Bluepers\r\nNumbers 1 to 13. Sizes are 2 discuss after','Asap',455,'2019-08-29 01:11:46','2019-08-29 01:11:46'),(20047,'No names on the back\nNumbers on the back:\n7\n13\n9\n44\n11\n8\n69\n10\n0\n1\nLogo is attached\nTeam name: How Spicy?','Asap',457,'2019-08-29 12:40:51','2019-08-29 12:40:51'),(20048,'Hi there, My team is looking to have new jersey in the upcoming season. we have about 15-20 rosters, you can see the attachment for the jersey design (ONLY THE NAVY ONE). can you kindly give a quote how much would it be? (per person) Also, do you also customize baseball hat?','March 2020',458,'2019-08-29 21:11:16','2019-08-29 21:11:16'),(20049,'logo (in white) on the middle of the back of jersey with small Canada flag below back collar','Oct',459,'2019-08-30 22:22:23','2019-08-30 22:22:23'),(20050,'Rangers logo (provided)\r\nNumber front left and back\r\nNo names\r\nSponsor logo front',NULL,460,'2019-09-01 16:41:02','2019-09-01 16:41:02'),(20051,'With number at back',NULL,462,'2019-09-02 13:30:00','2019-09-02 13:30:00'),(20052,'Yellow buttons, white number on the back and left sleeve, Edmonton eskimos logo on the right sleeve, and \"eskimos\" in yellow across the chest','02/09/2019',464,'2019-09-03 02:25:14','2019-09-03 02:25:14'),(20053,'SPARTANS - Front Center\nName and Numbers on the back\nPinstripes and writing in orange',NULL,465,'2019-09-03 15:10:37','2019-09-03 15:10:37'),(20054,'We are looking for 2 complete sets of Home and Away Jerseys, as well as a reversible practice Jersey. (So in total, there would be 24 complete uniforms + 12 reversible practice Jersey\'s). The reversible Jersey could be a lower cost material if that makes a difference (and no names required).\n\nHome Jersey/Shorts would be White, with Black and Gold trim on sides. Artwork attached for Home.\n\nAway Jersey/Shorts would be Black, with White and Gold trim on the sides. Artwork attached for Away.\n\nNumber on back with Name above.\n\nIf there is another uniform style that you would recommend, we are completely open to suggestions. We have not settled on the specific \"gold\" on the logo/uniform - but I believe that they would be the same tone/shade as the trim on the side of the uniform.\n\nLastly, we are also looking for Coaches shirts (Polo?), and possibly even Player Shooting Shirts and Hoodies for family members. This can be discussed once we settle on jersey\'s.\n\nPlease call with any questions.\n\nThanks,\nJeff\n(416)727-5474 cell','ASAP',466,'2019-09-03 22:24:10','2019-09-03 22:24:10'),(20055,'For the logo we want the Boar emoji ? numbers will be on the back and on the sleeves.',NULL,467,'2019-09-04 02:16:55','2019-09-04 02:16:55'),(20056,'Hi Teamco!\n\nWe are a new slowpitch softball team over in the UK and are looking for some pricing and 