09-07 20:01:37'),(20071,NULL,'September 27th',486,'2019-09-07 21:40:53','2019-09-07 21:40:53'),(20072,'Hi There. \n\nWe would like jerseys and socks for our 5/6 and 7/8 hockey teams from RA Steen Community Centre in Winnipeg Jets Aviator Blue and white with aviator and dark blue in a matching colour scheme.  Could you please give us a mock-up an quote?  \n\nThanks!\n\nEric',NULL,488,'2019-09-09 04:56:46','2019-09-09 04:56:46'),(20073,'We would like our logo on the front and Gat Leedm written below the logo.\nPossibly a number on the right hand side in front and a number on the back. No names required','Oct 1, 2019',497,'2019-09-09 21:06:52','2019-09-09 21:06:52'),(20074,'Numbers front and back, teams name on the back \"eagles\" \nNavy number in front , navy eagles hand writing and gold number in back',NULL,498,'2019-09-09 21:23:38','2019-09-09 21:23:38'),(20075,'Would like a Cardinal cartoon with a bat, across the chest, or a simple Cardinal.','April 20th, 2020',499,'2019-09-09 21:25:14','2019-09-09 21:25:14'),(20076,'Hello there. Looking for quote on jersey, sweater and kids jersey. Not sure how many of each yet, but it’ll be more than 10 of each. \r\n\r\nI can send you a photo or what I want looking at design wise',NULL,501,'2019-09-10 02:45:56','2019-09-10 02:45:56'),(20077,'Right chest- Number\r\nBelow Number\r\nFront centre- Are we able to take a logo off of a jersey that is an example? Our team name is Dino\'s so we were wondering if we would be able to take the T-Rex of your raptors jersey and put in on the front centre of this jersey. If you could let me know if this is a possibility that would be awesome!! I attached a screenshot of the example jersey.\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nCarleigh','10/09/2019',506,'2019-09-10 16:23:37','2019-09-10 16:23:37'),(20078,NULL,'09/11/2019',518,'2019-09-11 18:57:31','2019-09-11 18:57:31'),(20079,'We will need a dark & a white jersey - numbers 1-20','Sept. 11, 2019',519,'2019-09-11 19:50:47','2019-09-11 19:50:47'),(20080,'I would like to have \"TRO-VAL\" in the front center with the number centered below. On the back where it shows name on your artwork placement guide I would like to have our small Jays volleyball logo and the enlarged number on the back. I have attached photos of what our current jerseys look like on the front and back, as well as our Jays volleyball logo. If we could get these new ones to look fairly similar to what we already have, that would be great. Or if you might have a different vision of what they could look like, I would be open to seeing that as well.\nI would also like to have one of these jerseys a libero jersey. If we could have one of them so that the navy and white are switched on the jersey, but with the same design.','First League Game is Sept. 18',520,'2019-09-11 20:09:41','2019-09-11 20:09:41'),(20081,'This is a corporate company. We do not want Numbers, on the back we want Resurfacing, Railings, Lighting. We want it in the style of a Supercross Jersey and wicking material.','10/30/2019',521,'2019-09-11 21:49:33','2019-09-11 21:49:33'),(20082,'Back of Jersey:\n   - 8\" font size  numbers from 1-15 in the middle of \n     the jersey\n   - Stingers logo above the number, below the collar\nFront of Jersey:\n    - 6\" font size number in the middle of the jersey\n    - Bluffton 2.5\" font size- above the number\n\nI am looking for a quick reply, as I would like to purchase them tomorrow - Thursday, Sept. 12.  Sorry for the short notice - we unexpectedly added a new team to our school.','Sept. 26 or earlier, if possible',522,'2019-09-11 23:41:32','2019-09-11 23:41:32'),(20083,'For Style one I would like the W, volleyball, and maple leaf of my graphic to be white.\nFor style two I would like the black and white reversed.','ASAP',523,'2019-09-12 03:36:24','2019-09-12 03:36:24'),(20084,NULL,NULL,530,'2019-09-12 11:15:02','2019-09-12 11:15:02'),(20085,NULL,NULL,531,'2019-09-12 11:19:54','2019-09-12 11:19:54'),(20086,NULL,NULL,532,'2019-09-12 11:21:35','2019-09-12 11