aced on the jersey at the centre of the front and of the back.  The colour and brightness of the numbers must contrast with eh colour and brightness of the jerseys.  \r\n4.3.3.2 – The number must be a minimum of 10cm in height on the chest and a minimum of 15cm in height on the back.  The stripe forming the numbers shall be a minimum of 2cm in width.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for the numbers to be on the front and back as well as each players last name on the back. Thanks.','January 6-10',920,'2019-10-26 20:57:22','2019-10-26 20:57:22'),(20413,'RIDGE on chest','Nov 16',921,'2019-10-26 23:54:19','2019-10-26 23:54:19'),(20414,'Team name is PAAWIS.\r\nNo name, \r\nJust number at the back and under team name','Nov. 22 2019',922,'2019-10-27 00:34:23','2019-10-27 00:34:23'),(20415,NULL,'October 26, 2019',923,'2019-10-27 01:52:48','2019-10-27 01:52:48'),(20416,'Logo on front and number on the back.\r\nVarious sizes','As soon as possible.',924,'2019-10-27 01:57:56','2019-10-27 01:57:56'),(20417,'Logo on front RoyFoss Motors\r\nNumber on back',NULL,925,'2019-10-27 04:30:57','2019-10-27 04:30:57'),(20418,'Logo on Front center.  Player numbers only on the back.','December 2019',926,'2019-10-27 05:28:22','2019-10-27 05:28:22'),(20419,'Number,  name front team name','APRIL',927,'2019-10-27 12:47:32','2019-10-27 12:47:32'),(20420,'On back please have lettering “Crown” and on front the lettering “Defence”','November 28',928,'2019-10-27 12:55:40','2019-10-27 12:55:40'),(20421,'I am looking to make 2 custom football jerseys as a gift. We will print our company logo on the front and then a last name and a 2 digit number on the back.','Dec 1',929,'2019-10-27 15:46:22','2019-10-27 15:46:22'),(20422,'Logo on the front and name on the sleeve','November 30',930,'2019-10-27 16:09:20','2019-10-27 16:09:20'),(20423,'Is it possible to add a collar?\r\nThe name of team on the Front Center and the team logo on the left chest.\r\nPossibly the name of the team member on the back of the jersey as well