m considering are included in the quote. The colour schemes are still undetermined. I came across your site and was wondering if you could give me an idea what the cost would be. We have a tight timeline and would look to order these in the next week and would like to have them in the kid\'s hands as soon as possible. Also I have a few general questions about your product\n1. Does each style have it\'s own cost?\n2. What is the fit like of these and are samples available for sizing purposes.\n\nThanks and I look forward to hearing from you soon.',NULL,1173,'2019-11-22 03:09:45','2019-11-22 03:09:45'),(20577,'Would need a school name and mascot name front centre and the number on right chest on the front back with name on the back in the preview','Saturday 23',1175,'2019-11-22 17:48:42','2019-11-22 17:48:42'),(20578,'HOCKEY JERSEYS\n20 home(black) 20 away (white)with grey and silver\nMUCKERS\nHMP\nwith a logo picture( law enforcement)\nquote please what it would cost per jersey,\nIf I like the price will send more specific logo pic','no specific date',1176,'2019-11-23 14:23:00','2019-11-23 14:23:00'),(20579,'Large number on the back, team name on the front, perhaps a sponsor\'s logo on a sleeve.',NULL,1178,'2019-11-24 07:43:57','2019-11-24 07:43:57'),(20580,'we would like the school logo added to the front, with players number on the back.','January 4,2020',1179,'2019-11-24 11:54:35','2019-11-24 11:54:35'),(20581,'School logo on front. Players name and number on the back','January 4, 2020',1180,'2019-11-24 11:59:27','2019-11-24 11:59:27'),(20582,'Scholl logo on the front or just \"Saxons\" . and only a number on the back','Jan. 4, 2020',1181,'2019-11-24 19:46:40','2019-11-24 19:46:40'),(20583,NULL,'Jan 4, 2020',1182,'2019-11-24 19:48:13','2019-11-24 19:48:13'),(20584,'Under the number on the lower back. A logo (Papason) on the Front a little number on left chest and Zion across the chest.','Jan 03 2020',1183,'2019-11-24 20:07:18','2019-11-24 20:07:18'),(20585,'We have a logo. \r\nNot particular. just looking for a quote at this time for approx. 15 jerseys - youth.',NULL,1184,'2019-11-24 23:32:44','2019-11-24 23:32:44'),(20586,'Hi there,\nHHTH runs pro-am charity hockey tournaments that raise money for local homeless shelters. We are looking for a last minute jersey supplier who can sublimate a name bar and jersey numbers in a short period of time. \nTypically we would give you 20-40 jerseys on the monday and would require them by thursday. \nPlease let me know if this is doable and the price points.\nLaura',NULL,1185,'2019-11-25 15:52:08','2019-11-25 15:52:08'),(20587,'The name of the team would be Chapman. I am looking for 8 youth in medium size and 7 in large youth size.',NULL,1186,'2019-11-25 16:16:47','2019-11-25 16:16:47'),(20588,'Not defined yet, but we will require something simple.\n\nAt this point I need pricing.\n\nAlso we have to Female players.',NULL,1187,'2019-11-25 17:19:12','2019-11-25 17:19:12'),(20589,'Hi,\nLet me introduce myself, my name is Callum Paterson. I am the designer for Ontario team under Ontario Deaf Sports Association for the upcoming Canada Deaf Games that will be held this May 12-16, 2020 at Edmonton, Alberta. \n\nThe 2020 Canada Deaf Games is a qualifying event for a sport-specific international competition and the Deaflympics. These events are comparable in athletic excellence to the Olympics and Paralympics. These games provide an equal opportunity for Canadian deaf and hard of hearing athletes to experience competition at an elite level.\n\n2020 Canada Deaf Games (2020 CDG) represents the only competition, at the national level, for the Canadian Deaf and Hard of Hearing athletes to come together and demonstrate their training and talents. Based on the results from this tournament, the selected athletes will be invited to represent Canada on the National Team for the upcoming international Deaf sport events.\n\n2020 CDG also provides important social and personal growth for the participants when they come together in the sport community, reinforcing pride in their identities as athletes, as Deaf or Hard of Hearing persons, and as Canadians.\n\nI need uniforms for each sport categories, follwing up:\n\nWomen and Men\'s Volleyball\nIce Hockey\nBowling\nBadminton/Pickle-ball\nBasketball\nBowling\n\nThank you for your time. Hope to receive a response from you soon.\n\nYours truly,\n\nCallum Paterson',NULL,1188,'2019-11-25 21:00:44','2019-11-25 21:00:44'),(20590,'12 of this colour with 2 libero jerseys (1:White, 2:red, 3:black)\nnumbers on front and back with logo. Same layout as on the sample jersey.','Sep. 2020',1189,'2019-11-25 23:23:55','2019-11-25 23:23:55'),(20591,'We would like our Logos, Names and Numbers.','January 1, 2020',1190,'2019-11-26 02:36:56','2019-11-26 02:36:56'),(20592,NULL,'01/01/2020',1191,'2019-11-26 03:04:04','2019-11-26 03:04:04'),(20593,'- just the team name and number on the front \n- only number on back\n\nI would also get the matching shorts SBK 1054 TO',NULL,1196,'2019-11-26 14:29:54','2019-11-26 14:29:54'),(20594,'Looking for 40 reversible sublimated womens basketball uniforms','mid January',1197,'2019-11-26 14:34:14','2019-11-26 14:34:14'),(20595,'Hi there,\n\nI am looking to have a company logo and a last name etched on the back of the jersey along with a number.  Please provide a quote.  thanks.','November 26 2019',1202,'2019-11-26 20:41:26','2019-11-26 20:41:26'),(20596,'Numbers on front and back.... numbers 4 through 15.  “HILLS” printed on the front','December 28,2019',1203,'2019-11-26 20:41:29','2019-11-26 20:41:29'),(20597,'Number on front  and back\r\nlogo on front\r\nlast names on back',NULL,1205,'2019-11-26 23:36:17','2019-11-26 23:36:17'),(20598,'Name on back\r\nNumber on front an back\r\nLogo on front',NULL,1206,'2019-11-26 23:39:25','2019-11-26 23:39:25'),(20599,'What is the base cost per jersey?  Just wondering if my team members will be able to afford these jerseys.  What is the typical final cost per jersey with