ors.  Navy as the main color with Fusia and grey accents.  The team name is the Crushers',NULL,2886,'2020-11-21 23:17:23','2020-11-21 23:17:23'),(22042,'blank','asap',2888,'2020-11-23 09:04:30','2020-11-23 09:04:30'),(22043,'There will be a logo front center, name/number on back and number on sleeves. I\'m just looking for a quote to compare prices before I order the jerseys. Thank you!',NULL,2889,'2020-11-23 09:42:31','2020-11-23 09:42:31'),(22044,NULL,NULL,2891,'2020-11-23 14:21:16','2020-11-23 14:21:16'),(22045,NULL,'24/november/2020',2892,'2020-11-24 16:18:54','2020-11-24 16:18:54'),(22046,'Team name- WARRIORS diagonally on front of jersey (sewn on), numbers on back and sleeve (sewn on), matching socks (17 pairs)',NULL,2894,'2020-11-27 18:54:04','2020-11-27 18:54:04'),(22047,'Hello, \nI am just looking at prices. We need to order several team sets of jerseys. Our school colours are black, red and white.',NULL,2896,'2020-11-30 11:13:50','2020-11-30 11:13:50'),(22048,'Darts\nFull Back Name  (BUZZELL)\nFront chest in Script: Cathy\n\nRight chest in script:\nRenfrew Legion\n  Darts','December 1st/20',2898,'2020-11-30 14:00:55','2020-11-30 14:00:55'),(22049,'A few years ago we purchased approx. 100 practice jerseys for our football team.  I can\'t find a copy of the order, but I suspect there was 50 white and 50 black jerseys and a few red jerseys.  We did not have any artwork on them.  Could you please forward a quite for 50 white, 50 black and 5 red TEAMCO practice jerseys.  Thank you Tim McFadden, Campbell Collegiate, Regina',NULL,2900,'2020-12-02 14:50:43','2020-12-02 14:50:43'),(22050,'home and away jerseys.  Looking for black/yellow/orange old school Vancouver Canucks jersey style.','3 weeks',2901,'2020-12-03 13:05:03','2020-12-03 13:05:03'),(22051,'Hello and thank you for your time!\n\nWe are putting together a youth spring hockey team and I am starting to do some research on jersey options. Our team is all U13 aged players currently wearing sizes in the Youth