ussing with you!','Mid July',3630,'2021-06-14 23:23:23','2021-06-14 23:23:23'),(22624,'On the front of the shirt, our team name.\nOn the back of the shirt, name and number.\nSomewhere on the shirt, maybe back under the number, our team sponsor.',NULL,3633,'2021-06-15 08:38:17','2021-06-15 08:38:17'),(22625,'I would like to purchase a large order. This is a new league in the GTA and in total I will need 15 x 4 of the white along with 5 other color schemes. At the moment I need a quote on the team cost to compare with other wholesalers, thank you.','September',3634,'2021-06-15 10:46:03','2021-06-15 10:46:03'),(22626,'Will put several sponsors names on back.\nteam logo on front\nmix of womens and mens sizes\nDo you do ball caps?\nWant to get idea of cost for sponsors\nwill order 20 shirts not 40. Want to see if cost difference between styles?\nAlso interested in suggestions?\n\nthx!','asap',3635,'2021-06-15 11:10:31','2021-06-15 11:10:31'),(22627,'Team name: Bitch Sticks\r\n\r\nNumbers on the front and back','ASAP',3636,'2021-06-15 12:46:15','2021-06-15 12:46:15'),(22628,'We would just like the blank jerseys, prefer email responses. Thank you.',NULL,3637,'2021-06-15 15:16:26','2021-06-15 15:16:26'),(22629,'Hello,\n\nI\'m looking to get a quote and mock up for my company. We would like to use these as uniforms. We would like our logo on the left chest area and the logo on the back. I don\'t think we will be doing numbers. Pleas let me know if you need anymore information. \n\n\nCheers,\nJaiden Molina','June 15th, 2021',3638,'2021-06-15 17:39:16','2021-06-15 17:39:16'),(22630,'Number on back, no name\nLogo front and center','July 25, 2021',3639,'2021-06-15 17:58:58','2021-06-15 17:58:58'),(22631,NULL,NULL,3640,'2021-06-15 18:54:24','2021-06-15 18:54:24'),(22632,'My team name is the PELICANS. I would like PELICANS on the front of both Navy and White side. I would also like the numbers on the front and back of the jerseys on both sides as well. Just make it as neat as possible. Thank you.','6/16/2021',3641,'2021-06-15 19:48:11','2021-06-15 19:48:11'),(22633,'Would like jerseys to include:\n-screened script, \"POTSDAM\" on front, center chest, orange font with navy outline\n-number on back','July 5',3645,'2021-06-15 22:16:37','2021-06-15 22:16:37'),(22634,'I have an artist making up a logo for the team right now. The logo will be going front and center.  We would like numbers and nicknames. Also there is a company sponsoring the team,  the logo will be in the left sleeve. \nI am trying to figure out of you guys could have this order to Clearwater BC before the 15th of July.  We have a big provincial tournament and we need a professional look.  I am working on the roster right now,  I\'m just waiting for the logo to get finished up.  I need a quote that includes 15 jerseys and shipping. If needed I can send you the logo as soon as I get it and give you the roster to get the order processing. Let me know what you guys can do,  I would be so happy to work with your company! Get back to me as soon as you can!!!\nThanks so much, \nSheena Soroke','Before June 15th',3646,'2021-06-16 07:28:00','2021-06-16 07:28:00'),(22635,'15 baseball jerseys 2 button.','Asap',3649,'2021-06-16 15:32:10','2021-06-16 15:32:10'),(22636,'We have a logo along with side patches, numbers and names on them. Looking to have colours match based on our logo. please advise email address where logo\'s can be sent to',NULL,3650,'2021-06-16 16:27:34','2021-06-16 16:27:34'),(22637,'If possible, youth sizes. \n\nLogo 1: Front Centre\nLogo 2: Left Chest',NULL,3652,'2021-06-16 20:23:45','2021-06-16 20:23:45'),(22638,'Hi there, we are looking to get 4 custom jerseys with the team name Cabiners in the same way Warriors is written across the base SBL 1036F jersey (front center). We\'d also like a circular badge logo located in the left chest position which we would happily send via email. Players names and numbers respectively: SERV 11 DINGO 80 SKOULI 18 SPUD 67 in same oxford colour. Will have to check sizing later just wanted to gauge interest and pricing first.\n\nWe also wanted to stay local so we could pick the jerseys up as soon as possible since we wanted to get them before June 30th.\n\nLet us know and thanks in advance!\n-Matt','june 28th 2021',3653,'2021-06-16 22:33:41','2021-06-16 22:33:41'),(22639,'Team Name “Krazy Doggz”','7/1/2021',3654,'2021-06-16 23:21:30','2021-06-16 23:21:30'),(22640,'We would like movie logo from The Sandlot in yellow writing','ASAP',3655,'2021-06-17 00:51:33','2021-06-17 00:51:33'),(22641,NULL,'July 5th 2021',3656,'2021-06-17 02:44:21','2021-06-17 02:44:21'),(22642,'we require jerseys to be numbered on the back from number 1 to number 30.\nnumbers 1 to 15 size large. 16 to 30 size XL.\nOur team logo on the front left chest. We can supply art.','July 5th 2021',3657,'2021-06-17 04:55:31','2021-06-17 04:55:31'),(22643,'Simple logo in the center on the front with a number on the back.',NULL,3660,'2021-06-17 14:52:00','2021-06-17 14:52:00'),(22644,'I am looking for a quote for 12 jerseys, possibly 24 if the price is right and we order a second set in a different colour pattern. Not sure when the government will allow us to start games, so hoping the 3 week turnaround works',NULL,3661,'2021-06-17 15:12:51','2021-06-17 15:12:51'),(22645,'Looking for a quote to buy jerseys for sponsorship of my son’s soccer team. It’s U5 so they need to be youth sizes. We have vector for the logo that would go on it.','July 6th possibly?',3663,'2021-06-17 16:56:55','2021-06-17 16:56:55'),(22646,'I will have a logo to submit',NULL,3664,'2021-06-17 17:02:22','2021-06-17 17:02:22'),(22647,'Will submit logo',NULL,3665,'2021-06-17 17:08:10','2021-06-17 17:08:10'),(22648,'The logo will just be a simple one colour. Can you send me actual picture of the colours. Is the lime a neon green? Is the blue a bright blue?','July 30th',3667,'2021-06-17 18:33:27','2021-06-17 18:33:27'),(22649,'Logo from you “pirates camo” jersey. Same number styl