 the website is either the grey or white it would be perfect. I am looking for 17 total jerseys - 2 would be a goalie cut.','7/31/2021',3891,'2021-07-19 17:54:09','2021-07-19 17:54:09'),(22822,'We currently have a logo that’s two beer mugs cheersing with our team name (Brew Jays) but we are open to anything really. We would love the logo front centre or right upper corner. We would love names on the back but no numbers. Thanks so much!!',NULL,3892,'2021-07-19 19:13:32','2021-07-19 19:13:32'),(22823,'We are looking for apparel for our dance team - currently we know we want our company logo either front centre and/or Right/Left Chest, and potentially name below collar. Dance teams don\'t have numbers per team member but I see on the \'artwork placement guide\' that there are many possible combinations that we will have to discuss. For now, we simply want those customizations quoted. Question: are images screen printed or embroidered? Thank you!','July 19 2021',3893,'2021-07-19 20:03:03','2021-07-19 20:03:03'),(22824,'We are looking for apparel for our dance team - currently we know we want our company logo either front centre and/or Right/Left Chest, and potentially name below collar. Dance teams don\'t have numbers per team member but I see on the \'artwork placement guide\' that there are many possible combinations that we will have to discuss. For now, we simply want those customizations quoted. Question: are images screen printed or embroidered? Thank you!','July 19 2021',3894,'2021-07-19 20:21:45','2021-07-19 20:21:45'),(22825,'See previous descriptions','July 19 2021',3895,'2021-07-19 20:53:06','2021-07-19 20:53:06'),(22826,'Front Center team name crest in 2 colors\nFront number below crest and number on the back',NULL,3896,'2021-07-19 21:16:44','2021-07-19 21:16:44'),(22827,'Need team jerseys with just numbers for a last minute league that popped up.','August 1 2021',3898,'2021-07-20 07:08:05','2021-07-20 07:08:05'),(22828,'Hey how are you so im looking for cus