k as well as a name across the shoulders',NULL,4391,'2021-09-29 10:17:24','2021-09-29 10:17:24'),(23220,'Working out quotes for 1-2 Teams of girls Basketball.\nMaybe 13, maybe 25ish\nWe would want Team, Player on shirt, and numbers on both','ASAP',4392,'2021-09-29 12:26:07','2021-09-29 12:26:07'),(23221,'I\'m looking to purchase this item for resale. I would like to order it as a blank (as one solid color) if possible. What would your MOQ be and price per jersey? Thank you so much for your help!\n\nBest,\nGillian',NULL,4393,'2021-09-29 15:24:56','2021-09-29 15:24:56'),(23222,'We are looking for \"RSS and number\" on the front breast of the jersey. Number on the back. Can you give us an estimate for 30 jerseys and 60 jerseys incl shipping?\r\n\r\nThanks, \r\nDave',NULL,4395,'2021-09-29 17:31:09','2021-09-29 17:31:09'),(23223,'Just logo on the front and maybe some graphics of leaves and foliage.  Pete',NULL,4396,'2021-09-29 17:50:06','2021-09-29 17:50:06'),(23224,'We are currently looking for quote to see how much funds are needed to purchase jerseys for a school flag football team.  The girls are currently wearing the boys soccer jerseys which do not fit.',NULL,4397,'2021-09-29 19:54:12','2021-09-29 19:54:12'),(23225,'Looking into having jerseys made for a hockey tournament U11. Youth Large with a logo of a dragon text “Dragon Quest” in front and numbered. 17 of red, blue, green and yellow.\r\n\r\nHow much lead time is needed to add player names?',NULL,4398,'2021-09-30 01:48:34','2021-09-30 01:48:34'),(23226,'We just gonna add a logo at the left chest. I\'m still working with the design of the logo but it\'s gonna be simple. For now I wanna know how much gonna cost the 18 shirts with the number and player name on it. Inclued on this 18 it\'s the goalie shirt. For him I\'m just gonna switch the color canary to cobalt. Can you do that?\n\nThanks for you time.',NULL,4399,'2021-09-30 06:46:00','2021-09-30 06:46:00'),(23227,'Hi there, just looking for a quote for these jerseys. Wondering if it would be possible to do a team logo front and centre on the jersey and team name on the back where the player name would go. Thanks for your help!','Nov 1',4400,'2021-09-30 12:52:57','2021-09-30 12:52:57'),(23228,'Stewart Law written in likes of Boston College on front, white with black outline\r\n\r\nand number on back \r\n\r\n\r\nJust curious about cost and time Frame, thanks.','Oct 15',4402,'2021-09-30 16:55:57','2021-09-30 16:55:57'),(23229,'we need a little logo at the front and numbers on the back. we dont really need names','october 17',4403,'2021-09-30 20:50:23','2021-09-30 20:50:23'),(23230,'Company logo front centre of jersey - multi-coloured\n\'TEAM CANADA\' printed in block letters above the logo.','November 15, 2021',4404,'2021-10-01 10:00:49','2021-10-01 10:00:49'),(23231,'Numbers large back Center\r\nNumbers front left chest\r\nLogo front center','October 8',4405,'2021-10-02 08:22:35','2021-10-02 08:22:35'),(23232,NULL,'Asap',4406,'2021-10-02 09:57:20','2021-10-02 09:57:20'),(23233,'Hi! I am looking at replacing our school sports jerseys for a number of sports as the school name has changed.  Therefore, I need jerseys for the following teams: volleyball (men including shorts and women), basketball (men only, including shorts), curling (jackets), softball (men and women), track/xcountry (men and women) and an all round jersey (soccer, badminton, bowling for men and women). I\'m looking for 12 of ea for volley, basket and softball, 6 for curling, 20 for track/xcountry and 24 (12 men, 12 women) all round jersey. I chose Under Armor because you ask to choose one, but I\'m open to a variety of companies depending on the sport. I\'m looking for quality and comfort as these should last several years before replacing again. I\'ve ordered some uniforms from you before at my previous school and was pleased with the service and the quality.','Nov 15 2021',4407,'2021-10-02 11:28:11','2021-10-02 11:28:11'),(23234,'Just inquiring for our college to get new uniforms.',NULL,4409,'2021-10-02 18:28:46','2021-10-02 18:28:46'),(23235,'To clarify, I\'m not looking for 15 of each of these, but rather trying to narrow down options to potentially order 15 jerseys total. These are the main styles and color combinations that we\'re considering, in case the colors selected impact the pricing in any way.\n\nMy flag football team\'s season begins later this month, and we\'re considering buying a set of jerseys for all of our players. We\'re mostly men, but have 4 women on our team as well - is it possible to order a combination of men and women\'s jerseys, or does the min 10 pieces mean we\'d have to go with all men\'s jerseys? \n\nIt will be a mix of sizes, likely between small and XL, and each player will want to have a name and number on the jersey. We\'d likely want the numbers in the secondary color (i.e. gold or tangerine, depending on the color combination). Would it be more expensive to include the number on the front AND back of the jersey, vs. back only?\n\nLastly, do you provide samples if our team wants to review the physical jerseys before deciding between them?\n\nThanks in advance!\nNick',NULL,4410,'2021-10-02 18:33:31','2021-10-02 18:33:31'),(23236,'Logo on front\n\nname/number/position on sleeve',NULL,4411,'2021-10-02 19:21:41','2021-10-02 19:21:41'),(23237,'Was hoping to have reversible jerseys.\r\nAlso wanted to include shorts.',NULL,4412,'2021-10-03 11:27:22','2021-10-03 11:27:22'),(23238,'just for it to say panthers and the athletes number','October 3rd, 2021',4413,'2021-10-03 13:05:13','2021-10-03 13:05:13'),(23239,'Looking for a quote for U9 (2013/2014) hockey jerseys.  Custom logo being developed.',NULL,4414,'2021-10-03 13:47:03','2021-10-03 13:47:03'),(23240,NULL,'10/15/21',4415,'2021-10-03 14:13:06','2021-10-03 14:13:06'),(23241,'The number on the front and back\nLogo on the front center','10-3-21',4416,'2021-10-03 19:56:22','2021-10-03 19:56:22'),(23242,'White Number on the back. \r\nNo numbers on the sleeves \r\nWhite custom logo on the front. \r\n\r\n2 xl 3 xxl\r\n\r\nNumbers to be confirmed \r\n\r\nShipped to Merritt, British Columbia, Canada \r\n\r\nCan send you picture of jersey.','ASAP',4417,'2021-10-03 19:57:45','2021-10-03 19:57:45'),(23243,'Hello! I have logo that I would like to have on the front. where can I send it to?',NULL,4419,'2021-10-04 12:15:55','2021-10-04 12:15:55'),(23244,'Wolves logo (which I can send over) on the front, last names and numbers on the back','October 4, 2021',4420,'2021-10-04 13:26:12','2021-10-04 13:26:12'),(23245,'Numbers and school logo','ASAP',4421,'2021-10-04 15:31:08','2021-10-04 15:31:08'),(23246,'One logo on the front, sponsorship logo on the back and number on the back',NULL,4422,'2021-10-04 20:01:17','2021-10-04 20:01:17'),(23247,'Island lightning rod lightning \r\nLightning bolt on front',NULL,4424,'2021-10-05 08:27:26','2021-10-05 08:27:26'),(23248,NULL,'asap',4425,'2021-10-05 13:18:44','2021-10-05 13:18:44'),(23249,'Team name on the front , personal names on top back ( shoulders) as well as numbers on the back.','November 1/2021',4426,'2021-10-05 13:49:56','2021-10-05 13:49:56'),(23250,'Logo FRONT CENTER et LOWERBACK : \n\nRénovations Daniel Hébert','1 novembre 2021',4427,'2021-10-05 15:52:12','2021-10-05 15:52:12'),(23251,'These are for a Co-ed Ultimate team, so the order will be roughly split between men and womens jerseys, total 26 (finalizing details today)\nWe have all our logos and mock up ready in AI. \nTheir league has already started so anything that can rush this production would be greatly appreciated!\nThank you so much and look forward to hearing from you.','asap',4430,'2021-10-06 09:22:08','2021-10-06 09:22:08'),(23252,'Dear Teamco sportswear team,\n\nIm really interested in buying these jerseys for my team. Our main color  is green  and our secondary colors are gold and dark red. I can give you our logo too. We would need that on there as-well. \n\nThank you for your help,\n\nKind regards