nts on the jerseys? I\'d love to be able to do the split lettering Blue Jays font for the numbers.\r\n\r\nThanks.',NULL,5006,'2022-01-18 12:34:41','2022-01-18 12:34:41'),(23697,'Logo on right chest or front center, depending on style.\r\n\r\nNumber on back for all.\r\n\r\nVarious sizes needed. For grade 7-8. Possible same style with youth sizes would be preferable.\r\n\r\nP.S. Sorry about the multiple quotes. The previous ones can be ignored.',NULL,5007,'2022-01-18 12:39:39','2022-01-18 12:39:39'),(23698,'Dance team costume.','Jan.18 2022',5008,'2022-01-18 12:56:47','2022-01-18 12:56:47'),(23699,'We are hoping to get the word Dalhousie in the Swoosh font in white, black, and yellow. We would like to have this placed on the front centre of the jersey. \r\nWe would like to have player name and number on the back in the same three colours (white, black, and yellow). \r\nIf possible, we would like two of the jerseys to have a Captains \"C\" on the left chest.','March 12',5009,'2022-01-19 11:45:21','2022-01-19 11:45:21'),(23700,'Hello, I\'m looking to get a price on approximately 18 adult sublimated jerseys and a timeline after the order is placed. I don\'t have an exact jersey or logo selected, but have a good idea of what we are looking for, and hopefully we can finalize something soon. Looking for a blue, yellow/gold and white jersey (similar to St Louis Blues) with names, back and sleeve #\'s. Anything else you need, let me know. Thanks.',NULL,5010,'2022-01-19 14:29:23','2022-01-19 14:29:23'),(23701,'Hi there, would like to see a mock up please for this Jersey.\r\nWe would like the printed information & logo on the shirt to be in Azure.\r\nFront: Team name front and center: HiiT Squad.\r\nBack: Player Name, Player Number, Logo (I have jpeg)lower back\r\nRight Sleeve: Logo\r\nLeft Sleeve: Player #\r\nWe would also like to order SLS 1052 Ladies Tank - 10 same color as the Jerseys and same information on the front & back minus the sleeves. How do I send you the logo?','