22,'2022-01-21 16:07:03','2022-01-21 16:07:03'),(23711,'LOGO ON FRONT, SIDES OF ARMS, NUMBER AND NAME ON BACK.',NULL,5023,'2022-01-21 16:56:01','2022-01-21 16:56:01'),(23712,'Just simple wording of team name with small number on the front and name and number on the back.','March 15',5024,'2022-01-21 20:20:06','2022-01-21 20:20:06'),(23713,'We would like our logo centered in the middle in the gold color.\r\nLast names and number on them also.','04-25-22',5025,'2022-01-22 20:30:45','2022-01-22 20:30:45'),(23714,'PLAYER NAME AND NUMBER ON BACK\r\nTEAM LOGO AND TEAM NAME ON FRONT','1 MARCH 2022',5026,'2022-01-22 23:40:02','2022-01-22 23:40:02'),(23715,'if you can design something \r\n\r\nteam name: PHENOM\r\n\r\nNumbers: Front(small on the shoulder) and Back\r\n\r\nLast Names on the back','As soon as possible',5027,'2022-01-23 00:32:11','2022-01-23 00:32:11'),(23716,'The team name font and logo will be the same as our last uniforms (SO#107045).\r\nFor the hoodies and warmup shirts we want Team name front top center.\r\nTeam Logo Front center below team name.\r\nBack player name & Number\r\nAnd sponsor logo center below player number.','March 2022',5029,'2022-01-23 18:50:37','2022-01-23 18:50:37'),(23717,'I do not have a logo, was hoping you would have something on file.  Our team name is the Usual Suspects.  Our theme is kind of a old school mobster theme.  But I am open to change as this is our secondary jersey.   Can definitely be creative and different theme.   We would only want numbers on the back and possible the side arm. \r\n Thanks','01/23/22',5030,'2022-01-23 21:03:22','2022-01-23 21:03:22'),(23718,'On the front of jersey, company name / logo across the chest and player number in upper left\r\nOn the back, Canadian flag in top centre, and player number on the back','April 15',5031,'2022-01-24 21:24:23','2022-01-24 21:24:23'),(23719,'We are an independent professional baseball league in southeast Michigan. I am interested in quotes for our merchandise stores (retail replicas, not on-field team/player gear) and possibly youth dance team uniforms.\r\n \r\nI am looking into at least about 245 jerseys with the same design - Not sure if you\'d split that total up by size type: It would be around 155 adult jerseys and 90 youth jerseys. This is for our team the Utica Unicorns. The jerseys are mainly royal purple with a wordmark across the chest, and team & league logos on the sleeves, all of which we could provide and would not need to be designed. There are no names or numbers on the backs.\r\n\r\nFor the other three teams, we have more in stock, so whether it\'s worth ordering any will depend on the MOQs per design (colors/logos) and/or type (adult/youth). If you can let me know what that would be, or at what quantities price breaks come in, I will look to see what other teams it might make sense to order for. \r\n\r\nIn the past we have gotten full button jerseys with raglan sleeves. That would be my preference again, but I know some companies don\'t offer raglan, and I\'m open to hearing about prices on two-button henley designs too, especially for youth. \r\n\r\nOne concern will be the shipping and customs duties involved between Canada and the USA which will increase total costs over any item price. Please include/estimate this to the extent possible.\r\n\r\nThank you!','April 29, 2022',5034,'2022-01-25 14:54:59','2022-01-25 14:54:59'),(23720,'I would like a name of team in front, and nomber and name in the back ( in an other color )\r\n\r\nSorry for my poor english I am french speaking','Maimum beginning april',5035,'2022-01-25 16:09:11','2022-01-25 16:09:11'),(23721,'14 Jerseys and Socks for Hockey Team','Jan 25 2022',5036,'2022-01-25 19:35:59','2022-01-25 19:35:59'),(23722,'16 youth sized jerseys, vector logo on front, player name and number on back, please.','March 1, 2022',5037,'2022-01-25 19:59:51','2022-01-25 19:59:51'),(23723,'Name and # on back','January 25',5038,'2022-01-25 20:45:19','2022-01-25 20:45:19'),(23724,NULL,NULL,5039,'2022-01-25 20:54:04','2022-01-25 20:54:04'),(23725,NULL,'July',5040,'2022-01-25 21:31:53','2022-01-25 21:31:53'),(23726,'Logo on front with name \r\nNames and numbers on back','End of Feb',5041,'2022-01-25 22:12:00','2022-01-25 22:12:00'),(23727,'none','Month of April',5042,'2022-01-26 00:30:27','2022-01-26 00:30:27'),(23728,'No artwork but different sizes.',NULL,5043,'2022-01-26 10:57:56','2022-01-26 10:57:56'),(23729,'We would like sublimated basketball jerseys (similar colours to our last order for Delia School).\r\n\r\nI would like the logo on the leg of the shorts, maybe on the jersey somewhere. I will fill out the roster form.',NULL,5044,'2022-01-26 12:52:31','2022-01-26 12:52:31'),(23730,'number on back',NULL,5045,'2022-01-26 16:29:08','2022-01-26 16:29:08'),(23731,'Would like a number on the front and back of the jersey, with the team logo on the left chest, and our team sponsor on the right chest. Please send me a picture of a sample jersey so I can confirm material.','Jan 26, 2022',5046,'2022-01-26 17:03:43','2022-01-26 17:03:43'),(23732,'We will want a logo in the front centre.  Numbers on the back and sleeves.  Name at lower back.\r\n\r\nThis is a quote for 17.  We will get 2 sets of 17, second set will be similar with just opposite colours for as set of \"home\" jerseys.',NULL,5047,'2022-01-26 17:33:00','2022-01-26 17:33:00'),(23733,'We are called the Blaze so it would be something with a \"B\" nothing to fancy.','May13',5048,'2022-01-27 13:17:04','2022-01-27 13:17:04'),(23734,'Vector File logo will be provided. Front center chest, numbers on back and Sleeves','02.21.2022',5049,'2022-01-27 14:20:15','2022-01-27 14:20:15'),(23735,'Hello,\r\n\r\nI would like a logo of a Hawk in the left cheat area.\r\n\r\nin the middle would be the team name NWO HAWKS with the NWO on top and HAWKS below with a arch.\r\n\r\nno name bars but will have numbers, unsure of the type of numbers for #18 \r\n\r\nI would likely order 2 set, one dark and a light.',N