01-28 15:26:20'),(23749,'the wolverines logo on the front name and number on the back and sponsor on the sleeves','april 15th',5065,'2022-01-29 21:45:37','2022-01-29 21:45:37'),(23750,'Holdfast would go across the front of the Jersey','April 1',5067,'2022-01-30 14:16:38','2022-01-30 14:16:38'),(23751,'Hi there, We are a team a boy\'s volleyball team in Mississauga. We have an upcoming tournament and need Jerseys ASAP. We have designs already and were wondering how soon could we get them if we proceed right away? \r\n\r\nThanks, Omid','2022-01-30',5068,'2022-01-30 16:02:11','2022-01-30 16:02:11'),(23752,'Hi,\r\nI had mad an inquiry into a group of these hoodies for my team a while ago but now we\'re ready to start looking again. I don\'t know if you have that info saved but we would be looking at 14 of these hoodies.\r\nWe also wanted to check with you to see if these hoodies fit snug or do they fit loose compared to your baseball jersey sizes?\r\nThank you in advance for all of your help. \r\n\r\n-Cory',NULL,5069,'2022-01-30 18:37:42','2022-01-30 18:37:42'),(23753,'Logo across the chest, numbers on back, smaller number on front of all jerseys.\r\n\r\nLogo across the chest, number on back of 14 hoodies, other six hoodies just have logo across chest','Beginning of March',5070,'2022-01-30 19:42:03','2022-01-30 19:42:03'),(23754,'Hi there, can you please give me a quote for 12 uniforms, main color forrest green, white and black and yellow.','asap',5071,'2022-01-31 00:10:39','2022-01-31 00:10:39'),(23755,'I visualize our jerseys like the mens team Canada all black soccer set. With our team logo where their canada logo is (one side of chest), small number on the center of chest, large number on the back and then our team name across the top back shoulders. All black jersey with gold numbers and logo. \r\n\r\nLooking to get a full team set. Maybe 20. \r\n\r\nHow much per jersey? plus shipping? \r\n\r\nDo you do embroidery logos?',NULL,5072,'2022-01-31 02:10:41','2022-01-31 02:10:41'),(23756,'team name on the front and players name and number on the back','March 1,2022',5073,'2022-01-31 09:50:04','2022-01-31 09:50:04'),(23757,'Names on the back and number on front and back in white font outlined in maroon ideally, although simply having maroon numbers could work fine. \r\n\r\nThe team name “NoDignity” written along one of the front shoulders in a small font would also be a nice touch.','01/30/2022',5074,'2022-01-31 20:53:15','2022-01-31 20:53:15'),(23758,'We’re looking for 15 black and 15 white of these. One design for the front logo and everything else the same as shown here. I.e( numbers on sleeve and number/name on back) Thank you!','2/28',5077,'2022-02-01 13:03:20','2022-02-01 13:03:20'),(23759,'Logo on back\r\n\"DIGBY\" on chest\r\nno names or numbers',NULL,5078,'2022-02-01 14:16:07','2022-02-01 14:16:07'),(23760,NULL,'5/1/2022',5079,'2022-02-01 16:10:04','2022-02-01 16:10:04'),(23761,'Blue Devils written in black as is the sample above..\r\nAnd number on the back','April 10',5080,'2022-02-01 16:36:45','2022-02-01 16:36:45'),(23762,'Hello, \r\n\r\nMy name is Christopher Atallah and I am a video game developer working on a hockey video game. I was looking to have a jersey made with the game\'s logo on it for me to wear to events and in videos.\r\n\r\nI read that your minimum quantity is 10 and I was wondering if there was any way to order less than ten and what my minimum cost would be if I did need to purchase multiple jerseys?\r\n\r\nThanks very much,\r\nChris.',NULL,5082,'2022-02-01 20:06:41','2022-02-01 20:06:41'),(23763,'Hi - We do not have a specific logo but we were wondering if you had a logo of a Husky that we could use. \r\n\r\nWe are an after school program for at-risk Inuit boys in Cape Dorset Nunavut. We have approximately 15 boys and 5 Adults in the club right now but we were hoping to get a few more jerseys made to have in stock for future members. \r\n\r\nCan you give me a quote for each jersey - I would like to know the cost if we ordered 25, 40, or 50 of each style. \r\n\r\nThank you, \r\n\r\nmeghan','Spring 2021',5083,'2022-02-02 09:32:02','2022-02-02 09:32:02'),(23764,'We are looking at getting quotes for 25 basketball jerseys for a youth/boys team.','March 1, 2022',5084,'2022-02-02 15:19:37','2022-02-02 15:19:37'),(23765,'I would like a logo printed on it.  Our team name is the Blue Devils.  If you have something to accomodate that, I\'d like to look at what you have to offer.  Otherwise, I can send you a logo.  \r\n\r\nSo, 15 jerseys, numbered with a logo.  I\'ll need them for some time in April.  Can you please give me a quote?  Thank you',NULL,5085,'2022-02-02 21:24:03','2022-02-02 21:24:03'),(23766,'Hi, I need them blank and also 30 pairs of shorts.','asap',5086,'2022-02-03 12:53:53','2022-02-03 12:53:53'),(23767,'We have a logo we would like to add in the centre of the jersey. No numbers.','April 1st',5087,'2022-02-03 13:21:00','2022-02-03 13:21:00'),(23768,'We have a logo we can supply and want the words \"Morrin Mustangs\" on the front. Numbers and wording on the front in black and blue. \n\nNumbers on the back in black and blue.','March 1, 2022',5088,'2022-02-03 14:53:43','2022-02-03 14:53:43'),(23769,'just a logo on left chest of 4 playing cards (Ace of Hearts, Ace of Diamonds, etc.)\r\nnumber on back\r\nPossible script writing across top of back ACES',NULL,5089,'2022-02-03 16:42:29','2022-02-03 16:42:29'),(23770,'black, grey, white logo on chest only.','3/31/2022',5090,'2022-02-03 20:58:14','2022-02-03 20:58:14'),(23771,'Front center placed image:\r\nhttps://ibb.co/Dk63jJs',NULL,5091,'2022-02-04 01:23:46','2022-02-04 01:23:46'),(23772,'Our logo is Dirty Birds writing underneath a picture of a chicken, all in orange. It’s the logo for Dirty Birds chicken place in the states, just tweaked a little as to not copyright. We would get numbers on the back, but I’m unsure about getting names on the back.','April 5',5092,'2022-02-04 07:54:19','2022-02-04 07:54:19'),(23773,'Hey there, we would be looking to add a custom logo to this design either front centre or left chest. Names and numbers on the back would be great as well. Just curious about your prices.',NULL,5093,'2022-02-04 10:30:12','2022-02-04 10:30:12'),(23774,NULL,'April 2022',5094,'2022-02-04 15:28:06','2022-02-04 15:28:06'),(23775,'Kekambas on the front\r\nNumbers on the back',NULL,5095,'2022-02-04 16:02:10','2022-02-04 16:02:10'),(23776,'just looking for numbers for the back and surname',NULL,5097,'2022-02-05 10:30:07','2022-02-05 10:30:07'),(23777,NULL,NULL,5099,'2022-02-06 11:55:25','2022-02-06 11:55:25'),(23778,'Front logo, name in the back, number...also can you let me know which one of the basketball reversible jersey is the cheapest','April 1st',5100,'2022-02-06 18:00:58','2022-02-06 18:00:58'),(23779,'Recreational soccer team.\r\nWe would just like our numbers on the back. No logo. We are looking for a quote for 12-15 shirts.','ASAP.',5101,'2022-02-06 18:35:28','2022-02-06 18:35:28'),(23780,'I have a logo.  Not sure it’s high enough definition.',NULL,5102,'2022-02-06 20:00:26','2022-02-06 20:00:26'),(23781,'Logo on the front and player name on the back.','March 25',5103,'2022-02-07 09:45:19','2022-02-07 09:45:19'),(23782,NULL,'3 weeks',5104,'2022-02-07 12:25:17','2022-02-07 12:25:17'),(23783,'picture front center of a muscular rooster. name diagnal on back if possible, and a number on the shoulder above name.','2-7-2022',5105,'2022-02-07 13:38:42','2022-02-07 13:38:42'),(23784,'Canadian flag on the one arm, logo on the front (that we will provide), names on the back.','March 27, 2022',5106,'2022-02-07 13:47:43','2022-02-07 13:47:43'),(23785,'Would need youth size \r\nName on the back and possibly a sponsor\r\nLogo on the front \r\nNo last names\r\nIs there a cost to ship?',NULL,5107,'2022-02-07 14:32:50','2022-02-07 14:32:50'),(23786,'I\'m not sure on my colours for sure right now, but looking to know what type of price I\'m looking at.  I will need some larger sizes as well. I would like an emblem and a name. The team name will be The Hitmen and I\'ll have a mask emblem likely on the left upper chest .  Do colours change the price?',NULL,5109,'2022-02-07 16:25:42','2022-02-07 16:25:42'),(23787,'Would want a high school logo with school name across front and a number on both front and back.','March 1',5110,'2022-02-07 17:21:42','2022-02-07 17:21:42'),(23788,'Name of school, logo and number','July 2022',5111,'2022-02-07 18:02:29','2022-02-07 18:02:29'),(23789,'Our team name is Giants just like the San Francisco giants',NULL,5112,'2022-02-07 18:44:46','2022-02-07 18:44:46'),(23790,'Two colour numbers front and back, two colour block lettering front and back. Logo on leg',NULL,5113,'2022-02-07 18:57:17','2022-02-07 18:57:17'),(23791,'I have a three colour logo to go on the front . We are also looking to get numbers on the back.',NULL,5114,'2022-02-08 08:05:45','2022-02-08 08:05:45'),(23792,'Will need setup for logo. Team had a logo previously, but not a logo file. Will need some assistance to create.\r\nWill also need matching socks.\r\nMost jerseys will be Mens Small sizing. Order for 2 x U13 teams','March-April',5115,'2022-02-08 10:46:05','2022-02-08 10:46:05'),(23793,'Hi there!  I\'m looking to get a set of 14 baseball jerseys made for a friend\'s 50th birthday trip.  She loves the Cubs so wanted to mimic that style and then customize with individual names and numbers.  I randomly selected the SBL 1016F style because it had the pinstripes, but because we aren\'t actually playing sports in these, I am open to a less expensive option if you have one to suggest.\r\n\r\nThanks so much!\r\nJenny','May',5116,'2022-02-08 13:31:55','2022-02-08 13:31:55'),(23794,'I need Home and away jerseys. 16 jerseys in white with red accents, and 16 jerseys in red with white accents.','May 2022',5117,'2022-02-08 13:38:26','2022-02-08 13:38:26'),(23795,'We are looking for some fully sublimated hoodies to compliment some hockey jerseys we already have produced. Would this be something you can help with? We need them for March 17th. Is that a timeline that can be met? The jersey can be seen online: https://www.flamesport.com/products/hitmen-every-child-matters-jersey\r\nPlease let me know what your costs are in different quantities, from 50, 100, 250 and 500 please. Thanks!','March 17, 2022',5118,'2022-02-08 17:11:40','2022-02-08 17:11:40'),(23796,'SBL 1035 \"Guns\" in Navy yellow stitching Embroidered  across the chest\n# front left below logo Navy\nCrossed rifles on left arm\n# on back Navy\n\nSBL 1037\nLogo Left Chest Crosses Rifles\n# Right Chest Grey with yellow stitching\nBrewers baseball logo on Left arm\n# on Back Grey with Yellow Stitching','May 1 2022',5119,'2022-02-08 19:29:15','2022-02-08 19:29:15'),(23797,'Front Center rubber duck logo','April 15, 2022',5120,'2022-02-08 19:37:57','2022-02-08 19:37:57'),(23798,'We would like to have our team name/logo on the front. One sleeve cap to have the Canadian flag and the other sleeve cap to have a sponsor logo. The back would have the player last name and number.\r\n\r\nWhat is the shipping time for an order to BC? Our first tournament is scheduled for April 22','Sometime in April before the 22nd.',5121,'2022-02-08 20:14:58','2022-02-08 20:14:58'),(23799,'Men\'s volleyball jerseys, unsure of final choice on colour combo or jersey choice. Team logo on front, sponsor logo either on sleeve or on back, numbers from 1-12. What might cost and turnaround be? Awaiting your response with optimism, thank you.','As soon as practicable',5122,'2022-02-08 21:11:31','2022-02-08 21:11:31'),(23800,'A number of logos on sleeves and chest for sponsors, team name on front and number.','2022/02/08',5123,'2022-02-08 21:35:07','2022-02-08 21:35:07'),(23801,'We\'d require the name \"Hammers\" across the front, in the same style as how the LA Dodgers have their name.\r\n\r\nI\'d like to get a sample of the material if possible. If you\'re able to mail it, great. Otherwise, I\'d like to visit your office. \r\n\r\nThank you.\r\nMatt','2/9/22',5124,'2022-02-09 09:54:40','2022-02-09 09:54:40'),(23802,NULL,NULL,5127,'2022-02-09 15:15:37','2022-02-09 15:15:37'),(23803,'We are looking to purchase jerseys for a few spring tournaments.  We would have a logo, name on back, and numbers on back and arms. We are open to suggestions.','April 30, 2022',5128,'2022-02-09 15:49:00','2022-02-09 15:49:00'),(23804,'Front center number\r\nFront left chest school logo\r\nBack collar school name\r\nBack center number\r\nBelow black number paw print',NULL,5130,'2022-02-09 21:39:58','2022-02-09 21:39:58'),(23805,'We need numbers on front Center min 10cm\r\nNumbers on back min 15cm\r\nLine outlining numbers to be min 2 cm wide\r\nLast names\r\nTeam logo on right sleeve \r\n\r\nA rush on a set of 10 jerseys. Other jerseys aren’t needed until mar 9','Feb 24',5131,'2022-02-10 03:19:37','2022-02-10 03:19:37'),(23806,NULL,'May 24, 2022',5132,'2022-02-10 09:11:15','2022-02-10 09:11:15'),(23807,'It was have Red Sox across the front.  Number on the back.  Similar to the Boston Red Sox.','As soon as possible',5133,'2022-02-10 09:32:03','2022-02-10 09:32:03'),(23808,'Youth hockey practice jerseys\n15 black and 15 red\nFront of jersey to say Hard Work Hockey',NULL,5134,'2022-02-10 15:43:57','2022-02-10 15:43:57'),(23809,'Will need numbers on the front and back and the words Namgis Nation on the front of the jersey','March 25',5135,'2022-02-10 17:40:41','2022-02-10 17:40:41'),(23810,'Hi,\nWe\'ve never ordered these types of jersey before. It\'s just been plain dry fit shirts. Just curious on the cost?\n\nThank You,\nKim',NULL,5136,'2022-02-10 20:39:14','2022-02-10 20:39:14'),(23811,'Need logo in front through center band of grey. Number to be grey with azure outline. Follow link for logo https://www.dropbox.com/s/9cmyorcc0dofmtn/screenshot_20220210-224249_chrome.jpg?dl=0','Mid April',5137,'2022-02-10 23:01:18','2022-02-10 23:01:18'),(23812,'Good afternoon!\r\nI\'ve got a fierce group of 50-somethings who wanna relive their high school glory days with a throwback football jersey...\r\n\r\nWe\'re looking at TEAM NAME and PLAYER NUMBER on the front; PLAYER NUMBER on shoulders; PLAYER NAME and NUMBER on back.  Would also love to have our logo below collar on the back.  Name and number would be in Royal Blue with White outline.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to hearing back from you.\r\n\r\nCheers!\r\n\r\nRich','when you can!',5139,'2022-02-11 13:47:11','2022-02-11 13:47:11'),(23813,'I\'m looking for just a ballpark quote for 10 basketball jerseys.  Logo would be a single colour and I have it in multiple file formats, so no editing required.  Numbers just on the back and single colour.  No names.\n\nWhat is the jersey quality like?  If they are reversible, is the logo/numbers on both sides?  Are all jersey styles the same price?\n\nThank you.',NULL,5140,'2022-02-11 15:56:01','2022-02-11 15:56:01'),(23814,'We have already paid another company that has designed our shirt and have a JPG File already to be sent to you.\r\nWe are just looking for a price right now.\r\nLooking for 14-17 Softball Jerseys (Sublimated) Women and Mens team Jerseys. This is a mixed softball team.\r\nMaybe the design could be tweaked a tiny bit, but it\'s pretty much set.\r\nThanks, Chris','Feb 11/22',5141,'2022-02-11 18:44:30','2022-02-11 18:44:30'),(23815,'No artwork please- just a quote on the plain jerseys and how quickly those could ship out.  Thank you','Asap',5142,'2022-02-12 07:47:14','2022-02-12 07:47:14'),(23816,'We would like the word “Blazers” written across the chest in golden yellow. https://www.google.com/search?q=moosehead+logo&tbm=isch&ved=2ahUKEwij2_OVn_r1AhXfsXIEHQhZBH0Q2-cCegQIABAC&oq=moosehead+logo&gs_lcp=ChJtb2JpbGUtZ3dzLXdpei1pbWcQARgAMgUIABCABDIFCAAQgAQyBQgAEIAEMgYIABAFEB4yBggAEAgQHjoKCCMQ7wMQ6gIQJzoHCCMQ7wMQJzoICAAQgAQQsQM6BAgAEEM6BAgAEANQhgZYvyNglShoBXAAeACAAVCIAbAJkgECMTeYAQCgAQGwAQXAAQE&sclient=mobile-gws-wiz-img&ei=dLIHYqPRCd_jytMPiLKR6Ac&bih=720&biw=414&prmd=simxvn&rlz=1CDGOYI_enCA938CA938&hl=en-US#imgrc=GbmXSwySojYhVM This logo on right left and right shoulder.','April 1, 2022',5143,'2022-02-12 08:14:53','2022-02-12 08:14:53'),(23817,'Team name as “Brutes”. No specific logo right now. Placed front and Center. Black words with white outline and then another yellow outline if possible.','May 2022',5144,'2022-02-12 15:43:25','2022-02-12 15:43:25'),(23818,'We were just looking at ordering a new set of jerseys with the word SAVC on both sleeves, our team logo on the left chest and our numbers on the front centre and the back, we were also hoping to get our last names on our back above the number. If this is possible I would love a response as soon as possible as we are trying to get these in the next 3 weeks','Before April 2-3',5145,'2022-02-12 20:38:36','2022-02-12 20:38:36'),(23819,'On the back I want the letters “GHVBC” and underneath the numbers- I also have specific numbers I would like. On the front I would also like the numbers in teal outlined in black if you could.\r\nOnce I get the quote, I may also look at getting a black version of these jerseys as well.','none',5146,'2022-02-12 20:39:20','2022-02-12 20:39:20'),(23820,'Team name is “Ducks” Front Center\r\nNumbers on the back.\r\nI do have a logo sleeve we would like to add on the right sleeve if it’s not extra.','May 10',5147,'2022-02-13 13:15:08','2022-02-13 13:15:08'),(23821,'12 - 24 Jerseys with matching Shorts (2 Teams)\r\nTeam Logo (2 Colour)\r\nInterested in reversible option\r\nPlayer Name & Numbers','March 28, 2022',5148,'2022-02-13 13:39:04','2022-02-13 13:39:04'),(23822,NULL,'April 8th 2022',5149,'2022-02-13 15:48:22','2022-02-13 15:48:22'),(23823,'School logo front center\r\nNumber left chest\r\n\r\nNumber back center','Before August 2022',5150,'2022-02-13 22:41:18','2022-02-13 22:41:18'),(23824,'Test - plz ignore',NULL,5151,'2022-02-14 09:54:39','2022-02-14 09:54:39'),(23825,'Numbers on the back center.\r\nFront center logo with team name. 1 - 2 colours max.','May 10, 2022',5153,'2022-02-14 13:24:45','2022-02-14 13:24:45'),(23826,'team name on front and numbers on back for men\'s rec hockey. Thanks.',NULL,5158,'2022-02-14 15:05:57','2022-02-14 15:05:57'),(23827,'Number on back, crest on the front.',NULL,5159,'2022-02-14 15:08:32','2022-02-14 15:08:32'),(23828,'Needing 15 or so woman’s jerseys. Logo on front. Number and sponsor name on back.','April 10, 2022',5161,'2022-02-14 17:21:26','2022-02-14 17:21:26'),(23829,'Hi, this is the third year I am ordering Baseball Jerseys for the Chestermere Crushers.  However this time we are looking to order for the association which is 4 teams and the approximate number of jerseys is 75.  We want the same Varsity lettering across the chest as we have used before saying CHESTERMERE with players names on the back.  Colour for the lettering Navy with white outline. We would also like the same wave logo on the left sleeve as we have done on the previous two jerseys.\r\n\r\nWith this being an order for 4 teams we will have each team submit their own roster form but the invoice will be to our baseball association.  We can discuss this more through email and I can give you the contact for billing.\r\n\r\nThanks again and I look forward to seeing how these jerseys look!\r\n\r\nAaron Appleyard','April 1, 2022',5162,'2022-02-14 17:43:32','2022-02-14 17:43:32'),(23830,'Rock Rush\r\n\r\nCan provide logo if you can print it?','March 1/2022',5163,'2022-02-14 18:59:45','2022-02-14 18:59:45'),(23831,'I just need numbers from 4 to 11','Asap',5165,'2022-02-15 00:10:42','2022-02-15 00:10:42'),(23832,'sublimated front logo \r\nsponsor on back above numbers',NULL,5167,'2022-02-15 11:57:29','2022-02-15 11:57:29'),(23833,'Hi I would like to know the total cost for 26 basketball jerseys and matching shorts. I will be ordering a 13 away jerseys and 13 home jerseys. Also I will be needing them by the end of march and I live on Vancouver island in British Columbia. Would like to know the cost after taxes as I am working on getting a sponsor for the jerseys and need to give them a quote','March 30, 2022',5168,'2022-02-15 14:12:06','2022-02-15 14:12:06'),(23834,'Number and last name on the back- “Mustangs” and number on the front','Unsure',5169,'2022-02-15 16:15:27','2022-02-15 16:15:27'),(23835,'We would need 12 kids jerseys (8-9 years old)\r\nAnd 7 adults\r\n\r\nWe are looking for practice jerseys.','Feb 15 2022',5170,'2022-02-15 18:32:16','2022-02-15 18:32:16'),(23836,'We are inquiring about Jerseys for our upcoming tournament. Our logo is wanted front centre and name and numbers as usual on the back. I can provide the logo. Just wondering about prices and arrival time. Tournament is March 18th-20th/2022. Location is New Brunswick, Canada','March 15th/2022',5171,'2022-02-15 19:11:33','2022-02-15 19:11:33'),(23837,'logo on front (Mississippi Misfits)\r\nwas thinking a big block distressed M in black with the word Misfits in a slanted script font in white overlapping on top and over the M, and maybe the word Mississippi also in white in a simple small font above the Misfits and still on the big M\r\n\r\nplayer name on back and number on back and if included in price on the sleeves and possibly a canada flag at the back neck \r\nI think that is basically it  :)','end of March',5172,'2022-02-15 20:53:55','2022-02-15 20:53:55'),(23838,'Name and number in black a uruguay flag as the team logo','Asap',5173,'2022-02-15 23:53:10','2022-02-15 23:53:10'),(23839,'Were a satire gaming clan called C2 and would like shirts with our sort of inappropriate fun names. Our logo is a simple coral colour label that would be best in the front center. We were also wondering about the name space limit at the back and how many characters we can push for that area. If the character space limit is a problem, we were thinking about \"C2\" on the bottom collar at the back with the same font as the name font to save some space. Please let us know about the maximum character limit for the names.','2/15/2022',5174,'2022-02-16 00:01:38','2022-02-16 00:01:38'),(23840,'Number 1-11 youth large-9 and youth XL-2','March 9 2022',5175,'2022-02-16 06:47:57','2022-02-16 06:47:57'),(23841,'Looking to get a quote on 40 jerseys (20 home and 20 away) \r\nAlso include matching socks for both sets.\r\n\r\nI would like to see each jersey have:\r\n-logo on the front center\r\n-Name on the upper back\r\n-number on the back\r\n-sponsor on the lower back\r\n\r\nSizes from Youth Extra larger/ Adult small. - Age group- U11 kids.\r\nLooking to order this summer for next hockey season (2022-2023) \r\nIf you need more information please email me.\r\n\r\nThanks',NULL,5176,'2022-02-16 09:26:15','2022-02-16 09:26:15'),(23842,'names and numbers on the back. \r\n\r\nJust a letter on front for team name. \r\n\r\nNo art work.','April 20th 2022',5178,'2022-02-16 09:55:58','2022-02-16 09:55:58'),(23843,NULL,'Wed. Feb. 16, 2022',5180,'2022-02-16 10:23:38','2022-02-16 10:23:38'),(23844,'I am ordering team jerseys for a club program, I have a logo designed but not currently finished and would like a logo and team name on the front center of the jersey and numbers on the back.  No additional logos required.  Also I am interested in the reversible jersey option for this product.',NULL,5181,'2022-02-16 13:14:23','2022-02-16 13:14:23'),(23845,NULL,'May',5182,'2022-02-16 16:28:16','2022-02-16 16:28:16'),(23846,'Would like the team name \"Renegades\" and possibly a school logo front center with numbers on the back.',NULL,5183,'2022-02-16 16:41:41','2022-02-16 16:41:41'),(23847,NULL,'February 16th 2021',5184,'2022-02-16 18:03:04','2022-02-16 18:03:04'),(23848,NULL,'February 16th 2022',5185,'2022-02-16 18:12:14','2022-02-16 18:12:14'),(23849,NULL,'February 16th 2022',5186,'2022-02-16 18:16:05','2022-02-16 18:16:05'),(23850,'Team Name:\r\nSOX2BU2\r\n\r\nSponsor:\r\nSHELTER LOGISTICS\r\n\r\nLadies Tanks\r\nTeam Name Front\r\nName/Number - Back\r\nSponsor - Bottom\r\n\r\nMen\'s 2 Button\r\nTeam Name Front\r\nName/Number - Back\r\nSponsor - Sleeve\r\n\r\nThere could be more shirts to order, but this is a start :)\r\n\r\nThank you\r\n\r\nShellie','May 1st',5188,'2022-02-16 19:41:34','2022-02-16 19:41:34'),(23851,'I am looking for a quote on pinnies for practice for my youth lacrosse team.','April 1st',5189,'2022-02-16 21:10:31','2022-02-16 21:10:31'),(23852,NULL,NULL,5192,'2022-02-17 01:54:02','2022-02-17 01:54:02'),(23853,NULL,NULL,5193,'2022-02-17 01:55:17','2022-02-17 01:55:17'),(23854,NULL,NULL,5194,'2022-02-17 03:02:06','2022-02-17 03:02:06'),(23855,'2 colour logo placed center front\r\nnumber on center back','04-April2022',5195,'2022-02-17 08:31:12','2022-02-17 08:31:12'),(23856,'Hello!\r\n\r\nFor my team jerseys I’ll be looking for sleeveless full button Jerseys. They will likely be black with blue accents. (I haven’t picked the shade of blue yet)\r\n\r\nI’ll need the team name on the front (Monsters), numbers on the back snd my sponsors logo on it somewhere. \r\n\r\nI’m looking at purchasing 15 jerseys.\r\n\r\nI’m also open to not having buttons, so if you could price me button jerseys and non-button, that would be great.\r\n\r\nThanks so much!','April 2022',5196,'2022-02-17 08:47:36','2022-02-17 08:47:36'),(23857,'I want log on front names numbers on sleeves and back the art work I have is of a site I found','Before may 1',5197,'2022-02-17 10:42:47','2022-02-17 10:42:47'),(23858,NULL,NULL,5198,'2022-02-17 11:27:04','2022-02-17 11:27:04'),(23859,'We would want numbers and possibly names on the jerseys. I would like a price with and without names.','May 1/22',5199,'2022-02-17 12:51:05','2022-02-17 12:51:05'),(23860,'Hello,\r\n\r\nI\'m looking to get a quote for 25 jersey\'s. Logo front center, numbers on the back. We have a designed logo which I can provide.','April 4, 2022',5200,'2022-02-17 13:16:51','2022-02-17 13:16:51'),(23861,'Front Centre logo','March 15.2022',5201,'2022-02-17 13:38:42','2022-02-17 13:38:42'),(23862,'no artwork, thank you; just the shirts-they look awesome','before June',5202,'2022-02-17 15:08:19','2022-02-17 15:08:19'),(23863,'I would like a number centered on both the front and back of jersey and the name \"Live Oak\" on the top of the back of the jersey all in white.','March 4th',5203,'2022-02-17 15:40:54','2022-02-17 15:40:54'),(23864,'Team name RUNNERS \r\nName JEROME \r\nNumber 4 \r\nSize L\r\nPants? \r\nSocks? \r\nHat?','Feb. 17 2022',5205,'2022-02-17 16:57:27','2022-02-17 16:57:27'),(23865,'Would like Name and Number on back\r\n\r\nCompany sponsored logo on front crest\r\n\r\nCompany website url on back tail',NULL,5206,'2022-02-17 19:47:50','2022-02-17 19:47:50'),(23866,'I have a logo I would use for the for the front of the jersey let me know how I send it to you guys','April 15',5207,'2022-02-17 19:53:00','2022-02-17 19:53:00'),(23867,'Not sure what the artwork would be as of yet. This is a new team and I am just looking for a supplier for complete hockey uniforms. So home and away plus home and away socks and pant shells. If you have I would also be looking for pricing on team apparel. If you could let me what you have and the prices that would be great. Also if I choose to go with you what is the min order for the first and what is the min after the first order?',NULL,5208,'2022-02-17 20:42:37','2022-02-17 20:42:37'),(23868,'I like the “t” on the jersey with the wings. I also want the colours that are on the example. I had trouble matching them.','Asap',5209,'2022-02-17 20:42:56','2022-02-17 20:42:56'),(23869,'Grey Seahawks Logo\r\nGrey numbers\r\nSocks\r\nKids 7/8 years old','March 25',5210,'2022-02-17 21:01:31','2022-02-17 21:01:31'),(23870,'Just need “SUNNYVALE” down the front on a diagonal and a number on the back \r\n\r\n6 xxL\r\n3 xL\r\n3 L \r\n2 M \r\n2 S','ASAP',5211,'2022-02-18 08:27:05','2022-02-18 08:27:05'),(23871,'Hello. I\'d like a quote on 15 jerseys, of which one is goalie cut. Most will be XL in Size. We have a logo in PDF format that I can supply. Each Jersey will have a number of which I will supply a list.','Feb 18 2022',5212,'2022-02-18 10:26:36','2022-02-18 10:26:36'),(23872,'Numbers on the back\r\nBrew Jays on the front',NULL,5213,'2022-02-18 12:21:39','2022-02-18 12:21:39'),(23873,'Good day.  I have not determined the art work as of yet.  I am looking for options for team jerseys.  min order would be 25 maybe 30.  I have a few options I would like to look at but the jerseys must be lightweight.  They are for a para hockey team and heavy jerseys don\'t work.\r\n\r\nI would like art work on front, with number on side and back and player names (maybe) name plates might be a better idea?\r\n\r\nLooking at SHK 1089, SHK 1081, SHK 1091 or SHK 1096.  \r\n\r\nI am also considering a set of off color practice jerseys.  just need number on back and logo.  Can be lower quality simple jersey.\r\n\r\nCan you help.','TBD',5214,'2022-02-18 13:29:22','2022-02-18 13:29:22'),(23874,'Looking for a basic quote on a set of jerseys.  Will need 15 per set and would like our logo put on the front.  Not looking to order just yet but getting pricing for a minor hockey meeting. \r\n\r\nThanks',NULL,5215,'2022-02-18 15:06:50','2022-02-18 15:06:50'),(23875,'Numbers only, no name, 1 front logo. That\'s it.','April 1',5216,'2022-02-18 18:07:11','2022-02-18 18:07:11'),(23876,'Company logo front center\r\nNumber on back',NULL,5217,'2022-02-19 13:04:21','2022-02-19 13:04:21'),(23877,'We would like a number an name on the back and number on side arms. A center logo that we have. But I would like more information on the material.',NULL,5218,'2022-02-19 13:59:15','2022-02-19 13:59:15'),(23878,NULL,'asap',5219,'2022-02-19 16:21:42','2022-02-19 16:21:42'),(23879,'One colour front (Old English H in same Gold as jersey).\r\n\r\nVarsity numbers on back. (Same gold as jersey).',NULL,5220,'2022-02-20 11:10:13','2022-02-20 11:10:13'),(23880,'We have a three colour vector image that we\'d like printed on the front, and then we\'ll need numbers on the back.','April 24th',5221,'2022-02-20 14:50:15','2022-02-20 14:50:15'),(23881,'Logo and number','April 2022',5222,'2022-02-20 20:30:37','2022-02-20 20:30:37'),(23882,'Logo on the front with name and number on the back.',NULL,5223,'2022-02-21 01:17:07','2022-02-21 01:17:07'),(23883,NULL,'asap',5224,'2022-02-21 03:10:05','2022-02-21 03:10:05'),(23884,'Big number in the back, GITMIDIIK in the Front with logo.','March 4th',5225,'2022-02-21 11:11:32','2022-02-21 11:11:32'),(23885,'We have a logo to go on the front with a team name \r\nAlso would like names and numbers on the back','April 30',5226,'2022-02-21 11:45:58','2022-02-21 11:45:58'),(23886,'We have a logo to go on the front and names and numbers for the back \r\nThese are the men’s shirts we would like and have sent a previous request for 6 ladies sleeveless in the same colour scheme','April 30',5227,'2022-02-21 11:48:28','2022-02-21 11:48:28'),(23887,'Hi,\r\n\r\nThis is a request for a bachelor party jersey! The groom is a big raptors fan, so we are looking a the Raptors version. The logo on the front would be \"Tron Squad\". Then we would do a name and number for each one of us.\r\n\r\nWe have 8 guys in the bachelor party? Is it possible to reduce the minimum to 10 for us?\r\n\r\nThanks!','May 01 2022',5228,'2022-02-21 12:45:04','2022-02-21 12:45:04'),(23888,'We would like center logo.\r\nName and number on the back.\r\nNumbers on each arm.\r\nSmall logos on each shoulder,',NULL,5229,'2022-02-21 21:06:31','2022-02-21 21:06:31'),(23889,'Front Centre- SAUBLE\r\n                      BEACH \r\nBack name-  Sauble beach resort camp \r\n\r\nNumbers.  Random',NULL,5230,'2022-02-22 09:10:03','2022-02-22 09:10:03'),(23890,'Names over pocket, sponsor on right side chest text only, graphic of date slinger on left side facing dartboard graphic, Fiesta Jump & Bounce logo across bottom of back','4/1/2022',5231,'2022-02-22 10:20:05','2022-02-22 10:20:05'),(23891,'supplied logo across chest 10inches wide approx.  name and number on back',NULL,5232,'2022-02-22 12:14:13','2022-02-22 12:14:13'),(23892,'Logo on front, name on back','March 20th',5233,'2022-02-22 12:17:57','2022-02-22 12:17:57'),(23893,'Front chest “script logo”\r\nBack numbers and names',NULL,5234,'2022-02-22 12:18:03','2022-02-22 12:18:03');
