of the jersey, player name and number on the back for 11 males and 4 females (STONE, MADLAMBAYAN, KARMAS, PUAR) for a softball team. Font used for logo also attached (Benguiat Bold - File #2). Font for Player Name/Number should match color of logo and be Myriad Pro or Impact, whichever looks better. If possible, could player name also be curved, like sample attached (File #3). Needed, if possible, before end of day Friday, August 23rd, or at the latest, morning of Monday, August 26th.','1','Red',NULL,NULL,366,NULL,'2019-08-19 00:36:21','2019-08-19 00:36:21'),(1019,NULL,'Main Logo - Front\r\nSPC Logo - Right Sleeve\r\nSponsor Logo - Lower Back','1','White',NULL,NULL,370,NULL,'2019-08-19 18:56:45','2019-08-19 18:56:45'),(1020,NULL,'Sonic Main Logo - Front\r\nSPC Full Logo - Lower Back',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,371,NULL,'2019-08-19 19:56:15','2019-08-19 19:56:15'),(1021,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,372,NULL,'2019-08-19 20:29:24','2019-08-19 20:29:24'),(1022,NULL,'Hello, I was in contact with Rahim today about ordering track jerseys and having them by August 31st.  He said that if we were to get everything in today then they would be able to make that happen.  So here is all the information.  As for numbers, it doesn\'t matter which numbers are on which jerseys as long as each jersey has a number.  I have also included an updated logo with our school team name as well as our school name that we would like to use.  The logo is fine in the middle of the jersey with the number on the back.','2','Main Colour:Navy','Additional Colour: Red',NULL,373,NULL,'2019-08-19 20:46:52','2019-08-19 20:46:52'),(1023,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,374,NULL,'2019-08-19 20:54:16','2019-08-19 20:54:16'),(1024,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,375,NULL,'2019-08-19 20:58:23','2019-08-19 20:58:23'),(1025,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,376,NULL,'2019-08-19 21:09:43','2019-08-19 21:09:43'),(1026,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,377,NULL,'2019-08-19 21:15:35','2019-08-19 21:15:35'),(1027,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NU