d number on the back\r\nNumbers in the sleeves','2','Black','White',NULL,633,NULL,'2019-09-22 21:30:12','2019-09-22 21:30:12'),(1115,'Teamco Ref #20136','Not sure what inside and outside colors mean so I put in white.\n\nWe need the attached logo and the number under the logo on the front.\nOn the back, it would be just a name and a number\nPlease, make it a rush order. We would appreciate to have it as soon as possible since we\'re already playing. \n\nNOTE: All prints should be in white\n\nThank you!','White','White','White',NULL,637,NULL,'2019-09-23 15:16:37','2019-09-23 15:16:37'),(1116,NULL,'We have placed several orders in the past; I will attach a PDF confirmation of a past order that includes all the design details and logo. I hope it contains a vector image (or you still have one from an old order) because nobody at work seems to have one...','Gold',NULL,NULL,NULL,651,NULL,'2019-09-24 20:11:32','2019-09-24 20:11:32'),(1117,'3051 - Stadnyk','Logo Front Center, Number Right Chest, Logo Left Sleeve, Large Number Back Center','2','Red','Black',NULL,652,NULL,'2019-09-24 20:12:26','2019-09-24 20:12:26'),(1118,'Stadnyk - 3051','Jersey Number Right Chest, Logo Center Chest, Logo Left Chest, Number Center Back.  All Reds should be 1815C','2','1815C','Black',NULL,653,NULL,'2019-09-24 20:33:05','2019-09-24 20:33:05'),(1119,NULL,'I provided a picture of the logo to be placed on front center. I also provided the JPEG version just in case. Please do not include the white background on the jerseys. I provided names as well as numbers (placed under names) on each jersey. Thanks for your help and let me know if there is any other info you may need.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,657,NULL,'2019-09-25 01:47:35','2019-09-25 01:47:35'),(1120,'Greg','Main logo front center. Would like Canadian flag on right sleeve, and  small version of logo on left sleeve.','white','white','black',NULL,678,NULL,'2019-09-27 12:22:32','2019-09-27 12:22:32'),(1121,NULL,'As per attached picture here is a description of the artwork placement\r\n1: Front Center: Club Full Logo\r\n2: Left Chest: Small. number\r\n3: Bottom left Sleeve: Club Name\r\n4: Back Center: Large Number\r\n5: Below Collar: Club Small Logo',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,704,NULL,'2019-09-30 12:40:59','2019-09-30 12:40:59'),(1122,'20213','Front left chest: school logo \nFront center: number (10 cm) \nBack center: number (15 cm) \nBelow collar: school logo\n\nPlease print both the numbers and logos in black with a white outline.','black','black','white outline',NULL,712,NULL,'2019-09-30 17:30:57','2019-09-30 17:30:57'),(1123,NULL,'Team name Z.E.S.S Wolves in front with numbers in center\nnumbers in the back','2','White','Burgundy',NULL,720,NULL,'2019-10-01 16:22:47','2019-10-01 16:22:47'),(1124,NULL,'Kings Logo on Front\nand MR. Mikes logo on back bottom','Purple','White','Gold',NULL,727,NULL,'2019-10-02 04:58:51','2019-10-02 04:58:51'),(1125,'20245','Numbers in black with white outline: \n15 cm High Back \n10 cm High Front \n\nSchool logo in black with white outline: \nLeft Chest \nBelow collar \n\nNumbers font: STAHLS\' VARSITY','Black','Black','White',NULL,728,NULL,'2019-10-02 15:19:31','2019-10-02 15:19:31'),(1126,NULL,'Imported team logo on left chest.','2','Black','White',NULL,730,NULL,'2019-10-02 17:03:51','2019-10-02 17:03:51'),(1127,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,737,NULL,'2019-10-03 03:45:46','2019-10-03 03:45:46'),(1128,NULL,'Name and Number on the back\r\n\r\nlogo front \r\nteam name front center\r\n\r\nlogo on shorts\r\n\r\nWe don\'t have a digital team logo.  the team name is:\r\n\r\nTlkemcheen\r\n\r\nʔeskʷloʔqín tək helew̓\r\n\r\nI will attach a file for the artwork','2','Black','white',NULL,743,NULL,'2019-10-03 18:01:37','2019-10-03 18:01:37'),(1129,NULL,NULL,NULL,'White','Royal',NULL,746,NULL,'2019-10-03 19:14:09','2019-10-03 19:14:09'),(1130,'20106','Volleyball jerseys\r\n\r\nNumber on front \r\nEAGLES curved logo across the front, above the number\r\nlogo in the top left front part of the jersey\r\n\r\nlarge number in the back\r\n\r\nWe also need a Libero jersey with the number 00 on it.\r\n\r\nIan Hall\r\n902-314-3837\r\n\r\nPlease RUSH this order! Thank you very much.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,747,NULL,'2019-10-03 20:32:44','2019-10-03 20:32:44'),(1131,NULL,'We have a team logo we would like on the Front Center','1','Black',NULL,NULL,764,NULL,'2019-10-06 23:27:03','2019-10-06 23:27:03'),(1132,NULL,'Team logo on Front Center. Small # on left chest and large number on back front. Gerald Battist Trucking Limited logo below collar. I think I forgot to put these details in the other order I just submitted.','1','Red',NULL,NULL,765,NULL,'2019-10-06 23:35:53','2019-10-06 23:35:53'),(1133,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,766,NULL,'2019-10-06 23:55:07','2019-10-06 23:55:07'),(1134,NULL,'Logo on Front Center, and can we get the black inside the given logo and the orange outline to be changed to navy blue. Also would like to add a C to Zimmerman(17)jersey A to Slater(14, A to Snowden(94) if possible','3','Navy','White,Navy',NULL,776,NULL,'2019-10-07 18:51:13','2019-10-07 18:51:13'),(1135,NULL,'Team Logo (Pictou County Raptors in red lettering) Front Center.\r\nSmall Number on left chest.\r\nLarge number on Back Center\r\nSponsor logo (Gerald Battist Trucking Limited) below collar','1','Black or Red',NULL,NULL,781,NULL,'2019-10-07 23:19:05','2019-10-07 23:19:05'),(1136,NULL,'Team Logo on front center\r\nSmall number on left chest\r\nLarge number on Back center\r\nSponsor logo below collar','1','Black or Red',NULL,NULL,782,NULL,'2019-10-07 23:24:48','2019-10-07 23:24:48'),(1137,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,783,NULL,'2019-10-07 23:28:51','2019-10-07 23:28:51'),(1138,'#QR10191 - original order','Logo 1 is the Vagabonds logo. We would like it on the front center of the shirts. Logo 2 is the diabetes logo, which is a sponsor. We would like the diabetes logo on both sleeves of the shirt.','2','48','49',NULL,790,NULL,'2019-10-08 14:51:46','2019-10-08 14:51:46'),(1139,NULL,'Pleas