ar\r\n\r\n- Are you able to add a thin white line around the logo so it stands out a bit more on the jersey?.  I\'ve asked my corporate creative team, but waiting for a response \r\n\r\nI\'ve attached both white logo and black logo - are you able to do up a design with both so I can see what looks better?','Black with white outline',NULL,NULL,'N/A',5179,'{\"section_1\":{\"title\":\"1. Contact and Shipping Information\"},\"section_2\":{\"title\":\"2. Jersey Details\"},\"section_3\":{\"title\":\"3. Accessory Items\"},\"section_4\":{\"title\":\"4. Number Colors\"},\"section_5\":{\"title\":\"5. Artwork Placement and Order Description\"},\"section_6\":{\"title\":\"6. Jersey Quantities\"},\"section_7\":{\"title\":\"7. Shorts or Socks Quantities\"},\"section_8\":{\"title\":\"8. Team Roster\"},\"section_9\":{\"title\":\"9. Attach Logo(s)\"},\"section_10\":{\"title\":\"10. Resend email to:\"}}','2022-02-16 10:14:55','2022-02-18 11:32:21'),(1943,'General delivery','2 sets of jerseys and shorts / Similar set up to men\'s set previously orders\r\n\r\n\r\nMaaqtusiis - black set\r\nAhousaht - white set','Black and white',NULL,NULL,'Matching shorts for both sets',5187,'{\"section_1\":{\"title\":\"1. Contact and Shipping Information\"},\"section_2\":{\"title\":\"2. Jersey Details\"},\"section_3\":{\"title\":\"3. Accessory Items\"},\"section_4\":{\"title\":\"4. Number Colors\"},\"section_5\":{\"title\":\"5. Artwork Placement and Order Description\"},\"section_6\":{\"title\":\"6. Jersey Quantities\"},\"section_7\":{\"title\":\"7. Shorts or Socks Quantities\"},\"section_8\":{\"title\":\"8. Team Roster - Black and White sets\"},\"section_9\":{\"title\":\"9. Attach Logo(s)\"},\"section_10\":{\"title\":\"10. Resend email to:\"}}','2022-02-16 19:38:51','2022-02-18 11:01:03'),(1944,'23836','Would just like the logo and not any background behind it. Place the logo FRONT CENTER!\r\nI have attached a JPG and AI form images of out logo. Hopefully they are what your looking for!','RED',NULL,NULL,NULL,5190,NULL,'2022-02-16 21:41:54','2022-02-16 21:41:54'),(1945,'N/A','Our C2 logo and only our logo on the front center. Name and number on the back with our C2 logo on the below collar at the back above the names.','Coral as Outline and White as main',NULL,NULL,'N/A',5191,'{\"section_1\":{\"title\":\"1. Contact and Shipping Information\"},\"section_2\":{\"title\":\"2. Jersey Details\"},\"section_3\":{\"title\":\"3. Accessory Items\"},\"section_4\":{\"title\":\"4. Number Colors\"},\"section_5\":{\"title\":\"5. Artwork Placement and Order Description\"},\"section_6\":{\"title\":\"6. Jersey Quantities\"},\"section_7\":{\"title\":\"7. Shorts or Socks Quantities\"},\"section_8\":{\"title\":\"8. Team Roster\"},\"section_9\":{\"title\":\"9. Attach Logo(s)\"},\"section_10\":{\"title\":\"10. Resend email to:\"}}','2022-02-16 23:10:09','2022-02-18 11:53:00'),(1946,'General delivery','Reorder of both black and white sets plus shorts','Black',NULL,NULL,'Matching shorts',5204,'{\"section_1\":{\"title\":\"1. Contact and Shipping Information\"},\"section_2\":{\"title\":\"2. Jersey Details\"},\"section_3\":{\"title\":\"3. Accessory Items\"},\"section_4\":{\"title\":\"4. Number Colors\"},\"section_5\":{\"title\":\"5. Artwork Placement and Order Description\"},\"section_6\":{\"title\":\"6. Jersey Quantities\"},\"section_7\":{\"title\":\"7. Shorts or Socks Quantities\"},\"section_8\":{\"title\":\"8. Team Roster - Black & White Sets Same Roster\"},\"section_9\":{\"title\":\"9. Attach Logo(s)\"},\"section_10\":{\"title\":\"10. Resend email to:\"}}','2022-02-17 16:05:36','2022-02-18 14:18:06');
